{{template "head" .}}
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="spacer">
        <div class="hero-seller">
          <div class="hero-lead">
            <p class="lead"><strong>NSM</strong> is a modification for Grand Theft Auto&nbsp;V enabling you to play multiplayer on customized dedicated servers, powered by <strong>AFX</strong>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <div class="players">
              <span class="live-dot"></span>Join the <span class="current-players" data-stat="players">{{kfmt (index .Stats "Players")}}</span> people playing right now!
            </div>
            <div class="btnpadder" style="position:relative">
              <a id="dl" href="/download" data-no-spa="1">
                <span class="txt">DOWNLOAD CLIENT</span>
                <span class="desc">NSM.exe</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="plaText">By downloading, you agree to the <a href="/docs">NSM Terms of Service</a></p>
            <div class="server">
              <a class="btn block" href="/keymaster">Create your own server</a>
            </div>
            <div class="nsm-quick-links">
              <a href="/servers">Server List</a>
              <a href="/keymaster">Keymaster</a>
              <a href="/forum">Forum</a>
              <a href="/docs">Docs</a>
              <a href="/support">Support</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
<main>

<section class="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="spacer">
      <div class="preamb">
        <p>Building upon years of development on the <strong>AFX</strong> framework, which has played a giant role in the modding community, NSM offers a huge range of features:</p>
      </div>
      <h1>What we have for you</h1>
      <div class="fx">
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a1">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">cloud_download</span></div>
            <h2>Streaming</h2>
            <span class="txt">NSM allows servers to use custom cars, maps, weapons, and more dynamically.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a2">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">sync_alt</span></div>
            <h2>Sync quality</h2>
            <span class="txt">NSM uses the original network code, improved upon by AFX OneSync, so you'll have the best sync around.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a3">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">groups</span></div>
            <h2>OneSync</h2>
            <span class="txt">Play with up to 2048 players on a single dedicated server with full entity and population synchronization.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a4">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">shield</span></div>
            <h2>Standalone</h2>
            <span class="txt">NSM does not interact with the Rockstar Online Services other than to validate your game copy when you first launch it.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a1">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">dns</span></div>
            <h2>Dedicated servers</h2>
            <span class="txt">Browse and filter community servers live in NSM.exe or on the web, with instant one-click connection.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a2">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">vpn_key</span></div>
            <h2>AFX Portal</h2>
            <span class="txt">Issue and manage server license keys, view active heartbeats, and link your AFX account directly in NSM.exe.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a3">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">code</span></div>
            <h2>Lua, C# &amp; JS</h2>
            <span class="txt">Build rich gamemodes, NUI interfaces, and custom gameplay systems using Lua, C#, or JavaScript runtimes.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="c-lg-3 c-md-6 c-sm-6 c-xs-12">
          <article class="a4">
            <div class="icon-wrap"><span class="material-icons-outlined">forum</span></div>
            <h2>Community</h2>
            <span class="txt">Share releases, discuss scripts, and discover resources on the AFX Forum and AFX Marketplace.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="closing">...and a <strong>lot</strong> more!</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="enhanced">
  <div class="root">
    <div class="inner-root">
      <div class="content">
        <div class="cleft">
          <span class="ea-badge">Now Available</span>
          <h1>Now supporting Grand Theft Auto V Enhanced</h1>
          <p>Jump into customized dedicated servers with the NSM desktop client, browse the live server list, and manage your server keys in AFX Portal.</p>
          <hr>
          <div class="btnrow">
            <a class="ghostbtn" href="/servers">
              <div class="in"><span class="gbtn-txt">Open Live Server List</span></div>
            </a>
            <span class="dl-text"><strong data-stat="servers">{{index .Stats "Servers"}}</strong> live servers &middot; <strong data-stat="players">{{kfmt (index .Stats "Players")}}</strong> players online</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cright"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

