          <h2>Minimum</h2>
          <table class="stat-table">
            <tr><td class="stat">CPU</td><td>Intel Core 2 Quad CPU Q6600 @ 2.40GHz / AMD Phenom 9850 @ 2.5GHz</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="stat">GPU</td><td>NVIDIA 9800 GT 1GB / AMD HD 4870 1GB / Intel HD GT2</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="stat">RAM</td><td>8GB</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="stat">HDD</td><td>72GB + ~4GB for NSM cache</td></tr>
          </table>
